				<r3d:description language="eng">The NSIDC Distributed Active Archive Center (DAAC) processes, archives, documents, and distributes data from NASA&#039;s past and current Earth Observing System (EOS) satellites and field measurement programs. The NSIDC DAAC focuses on the study of the cryosphere.
The NSIDC DAAC is one of NASA&#039;s Earth Observing System Data and Information System (EOSDIS) Data Centers.</r3d:description>
