						<r3d:remarks>The NSIDC DAAC is one of NASA&#039;s Earth Observing System Data and Information System (EOSDIS) Data Centers. Each data center serves one or more specific Earth science disciplines and provides its user community with data products, data information, user services, and tools unique to its particular science. Each data center is also guided by a User Working Group (UWG) in identifying and generating these needed data products.
NSIDC DAAC is a regular member of ICSU World Data System.</r3d:remarks>
